{'symbol': 'MSFT', 'date': '2023-04-25 11:00:00', 'title': 'SINCH ANNOUNCES MICROSOFT TEAMS PROFESSIONAL AND MANAGED SERVICES PARTNERSHIP WITH SYNOPTEK', 'text': 'CHICAGO AND STOCKHOLM , APRIL 25, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SINCH,\xa0WHICH POWERS MEANINGFUL CONVERSATIONS BETWEEN BUSINESSES AND THEIR CUSTOMERS THROUGH ITS CUSTOMER COMMUNICATIONS CLOUD, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL NOW OFFER PROFESSIONAL AND MANAGED SERVICES FOR MICROSOFT TEAMS PHONE SYSTEM, INTEGRATED WITH OPERATOR CONNECT OR DIRECT ROUTING THROUGH A NEW PARTNERSHIP WITH SYNOPTEK, A LEADING GLOBAL BUSINESS AND DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION ADVISORY AND CONSULTING FIRM AND MICROSOFT GOLD PARTNER. ENTERPRISE CUSTOMERS HAVE A SIGNIFICANT DEMAND FOR PROFESSIONAL SERVICES TO AUGMENT THEIR STAFF FOR MANAGING THE IMPLEMENTATION, DEPLOYMENT, AND SUPPORT OF MICROSOFT TEAMS PHONE SYSTEM AND CONNECTIVITY TO THE PUBLIC SWITCHED TELEPHONE NETWORK (PSTN).'}